KV Pressure Lab

Includes the unmodified P-PAS scheduler patch by Timo Sämann and contributors,
from https://github.com/TimoSaemann/ppas-vllm at the commit in
vendor/provenance.json. Its Apache-2.0 license is retained in vendor/PPAS-LICENSE.
